# Five-orites Scoop — Cloud Functions .gitignore
#
# The root .gitignore has `dist/` and `www/` for the Angular build but nothing
# for the Functions build, so `functions/lib/` would otherwise be committed —
# generated JavaScript that duplicates src/ line for line and goes stale
# between edits and builds.

# tsc output (functions/package.json main -> lib/index.js)
lib/

# Dependencies: firebase-admin, firebase-functions, typescript.
# The root .gitignore already covers the app's node_modules; this is the
# functions package's own.
node_modules/